  "name": "Mercenary for Hire!: a first strike on a same-faction innocent gives Criminal for 2, a kill for 8 minutes",
  "contract": [
    "Issue #9132: a Mercenary who killed their own faction got no visible debuff. Mercenary for Hire! 9930874 used",
    "to cast 9930862 Criminal - Visual, an empty aura without an icon; 9930873 Criminal: Blood On Your Hands is the",
    "visible debuff and triggers that visual itself. The PR author's ruling (2026-11-25): hitting a non-Mercenary",
    "player who did not attack first gives 2 minutes, killing one gives 8 minutes, and Criminal time never exceeds",
    "8 minutes; a further hit tops the timer up to 2 minutes when less is left. The tooltip names the Mercenary's",
    "own faction, so a Horde War Mode player hit by an Alliance Mercenary gives nothing. Two War Mode Humans and a",
    "High-Risk Human Mercenary pick their rulesets in Stormwind and fight in Elwynn Forest with a War Mode Orc.",
    "Dodge and parry are zeroed on the victims so every timed hit lands."
  ],
